L1  3 9 1m
C4  3 0 330p
C5  9 0 330p
R6  3 0 1meg
*
* --- Back-to-back varactors ---
D1  3 8 DBB112                 ; anode node 3, cathode node 8
D2  9 8 DBB112                 ; anode node 9, cathode node 8
R5  7 8 10k
